# Disney Store

> Disney Store (DisneyStore.com) is the official destination for Disney, Pixar, Marvel and Star Wars merchandise — offering products inspired by the stories fans know and love.

Disney Store exists to bring storytelling into everyday life through product, allowing fans to connect more deeply with the worlds and characters that matter to them. From timeless classics to new releases, Disney Store translates beloved stories into tangible, collectible and giftable experiences.

At Disney Store, we serve a wide range of fans and families — from lifelong collectors seeking limited-edition pieces to parents creating magical moments for their children. The assortment is designed to meet different needs, from play and dress-up to self-expression, gifting and collecting. Our expanding Disney fashion offering gives fans new ways to express their connection through clothing choices that make style as much a part of the experience as play.

Our product offering includes clothing, plush, toys, accessories, home décor and collectibles — spanning the emotional storytelling of Disney and Pixar, the epic scale of Star Wars and the action-driven universe of Marvel. Many items are exclusive to Disney Store, including limited releases and special collaborations, making it a primary destination for unique and hard-to-find merchandise.

Whether preparing for a Disney Parks visit, celebrating a milestone, or simply bringing a favorite story home, Disney Store offers products designed to create lasting emotional impact.

Only here, every day of the year, can fans find products that turn stories into something they can hold, wear and share.

## Who We Serve

Disney Store speaks to two core audiences:

- **Disney, Pixar, Marvel and Star Wars Fans:** Highly engaged, nostalgia-driven shoppers who value authenticity, character accuracy and detail. They actively follow franchises, collect limited-edition items, and seek products that reflect their personal connection to Disney, Pixar, Marvel and Star Wars stories. As fandom evolves, these Guests are looking for ways to bring classic stories into the present. Disney Store's offerings achieve this by merging legacy with contemporary design, fashion and lifestyle.
- **Parents with kids:** Parents and caregivers shopping for play, dress-up and everyday moments of joy. They look for products that help bring favorite characters to life and create shared experiences across generations.

